["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/RelationshipType/hasProvidedDependency", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The `from` Element has a dependency on each `to` Element, dependency is not in the distributed artifact, but assumed to be provided, during a LifecycleScopeType period.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
